| Partitioning                      | [PostgreSQL partitioning](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-partitioning.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)                                                |
| Document modeling                 | [MongoDB data modeling](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/data-modeling//?utm_source=chatgpt.com)                                                            |
| Document denormalization          | [MongoDB modeling practices](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/data-modeling/best-practices/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)                                         |
